error[E0301]: `==` on `P` needs the trait `Eq`, and no `Eq` is in scope or reachable from this file
 --> mem:///main.lu:7:8
  |
7 |     if a == b { 0 } else { 1 }
  |        ^ this is `P`, not a primitive
  |
  = note: an operator on a user type dispatches through its trait ([type.trait.op]): `==` is
    `Eq.eq`. The trait is looked for under that name in scope, then in `P`'s own module,
    then in the modules this file imports (std.ops and std.cmp declare the eight) — declare
    it, or import the module that does, and give `P` an `impl Eq`.
